---
subject: Confirm your new email address for <%= it.appName %>
preheader: Approve the new email address for your account.
---
<div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb;">Email change requested</div><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#18181b;">Confirm your new email address</h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;">A request was made to change the email address on your <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.appName %></strong> account.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;background-color:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:10px;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#71717a;width:38%;vertical-align:top;">New email address</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#18181b;font-weight:600;vertical-align:top;"><%= it.newEmail %></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#71717a;width:38%;vertical-align:top;">Link expires in</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#18181b;font-weight:600;vertical-align:top;"><%= it.expiresInHours %> hour<%= it.expiresInHours === 1 ? '' : 's' %></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:26px 0 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#2563eb" style="border-radius:10px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a class="email-btn" href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Confirm new email</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:6px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background-color:#f4f4f7;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-all;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;"><%= it.url %></a></p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;"><tr><td style="padding:12px 14px;background-color:#fafafa;border-left:3px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:4px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If you didn&#39;t request this change, contact support immediately. Your account may be compromised.</td></tr></table>
===TEXT===
Confirm your new email address for <%= it.appName %>

A request was made to change the email on your account to <%= it.newEmail %>.
Open the link below to confirm. The link expires in <%= it.expiresInHours %>
hour(s).

  <%= it.url %>

If you didn't request this change, contact support immediately.
